            xmlns:illustrator="http://ns.adobe.com/illustrator/1.0/">
         <pdf:Producer>Acrobat Distiller 10.0.0 (Windows)</pdf:Producer>
         <xmp:CreatorTool>BroadVision, Inc.</xmp:CreatorTool>
         <xmp:ModifyDate>2020-09-09T09:42:13+02:00</xmp:ModifyDate>
         <xmp:CreateDate>2015-04-23T14:30:10-07:00</xmp:CreateDate>
         <xmp:MetadataDate>2020-09-09T09:42:13+02:00</xmp:MetadataDate>
         <dc:format>application/pdf</dc:format>
         <dc:title>
            <rdf:Alt>
               <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">NCP1203 - PWM Controller, Fixed Frequency, Flyback, Current Mode</rdf:li>
            </rdf:Alt>
         </dc:title>
         <dc:creator>
            <rdf:Seq>
               <rdf:li>ON Semiconductor</rdf:li>
            </rdf:Seq>
         </dc:creator>
         <dc:description>
            <rdf:Alt>
               <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Housed in SOICâˆ’8 or PDIPâˆ’8 package, the NCP1203 represents a&#xD;&#xA;major leap toward ultraâˆ’compact Switchmode Power Supplies and&#xD;&#xA;represents an excellent candidate to replace the UC384X devices. Due&#xD;&#xA;to its proprietary SMARTMOSâ„¢ Very High Voltage Technology, the&#xD;&#xA;circuit allows the implementation of complete offâˆ’line ACâˆ’DC&#xD;&#xA;adapters, battery charger and a highâˆ’power SMPS with few external&#xD;&#xA;components.&#xD;&#xA;With an internal structure operating at a fixed 40 kHz, 60 kHz or&#xD;&#xA;100 kHz switching frequency, the controller features a highâˆ’voltage&#xD;&#xA;startup FET which ensures a clean and lossâˆ’less startup sequence. Its&#xD;&#xA;currentâˆ’mode control naturally provides good audioâˆ’susceptibility&#xD;&#xA;and inherent pulseâˆ’byâˆ’pulse control.&#xD;&#xA;When the current setpoint falls below a given value, e.g. the output&#xD;&#xA;power demand diminishes, the IC automatically enters the soâˆ’called&#xD;&#xA;skip cycle mode and provides improved efficiency at light loads&#xD;&#xA;while offering excellent performance in standby conditions. Because&#xD;&#xA;this occurs at a user adjustable low peak current, no acoustic noise&#xD;&#xA;takes place.&#xD;&#xA;The NCP1203 also includes an efficient protective circuitry which,&#xD;&#xA;in presence of an output over load condition, disables the output&#xD;&#xA;pulses while the device enters a safe burst mode, trying to restart.&#xD;&#xA;Once the default has gone, the device autoâˆ’recovers. Finally, a&#xD;&#xA;temperature shutdown with hysteresis helps building safe and robust&#xD;&#xA;power supplies.</rdf:li>
            </rdf:Alt>
         </dc:description>
         <xmpMM:DocumentID>uuid:af6b9d02-42e7-43a4-b0fe-e8a074a74432</xmpMM:DocumentID>
         <xmpMM:InstanceID>uuid:8873add2-585c-4957-9b75-1779251848dc</xmpMM:InstanceID>
         <illustrator:StartupProfile>Print</illustrator:StartupProfile>
      </rdf:Description>
